# Arc 3 · Mission 0 — First Generation. The first bred opponent (evolved lineage 0).
# Nobody wrote it: it is the best of a population that was scored on the arena boards. It expands
# fast, keeps almost no garrison, and reads how much of your fleet is in the air. The player
# starts with an extra post and a larger garrison.

